text = "HOW TO PLAY

Every level has a broken system.

Read the screen.
It tells you what the system needs.

Move with W A S D
or Arrow Keys.

Pick values with X.
Drop value with E.
Insert with SPACE.
Retrieve from slots with R.

Restore the system
to open the door."
